#> tool: awkrepl
#> wait: fields, last =
#> pause: 30
#> must: 1: 4 fields, last = 2026-01-05
#> must: 4: 3 fields, last = marketing
#> must: 6: 1 fields, last = end
#> not: 0 fields
#> source: fields, last
# 2. NF and NR: the number of fields, and the record count so far
# The sheet: NF is "The Number of Fields in the current input record", NR "The
# total Number of input Records seen so far". Both change on every line.
# Using NF alone as the pattern skips blank lines: 0 fields is false. Line 3 is
# blank here, so it is counted by NR but never printed.
# Try: remove the 'NF' pattern and watch "0 fields, last =" appear for line 3.
NF { print NR ": " NF " fields, last = " $NF }

#DATA
alice 42 engineering 2026-01-05
bob 17 marketing 2026-01-05

carol 88 marketing
dave 5 support 2026-01-06 remote
end
